4.003.1","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.df86bcb3eaadf4c19b00acfb0d84d7c4e2aa3674.003.1"},{"event":"Freeze Watch","headline":"Freeze Watch issued October 16 at 12:33AM MDT until October 17 at 9:00AM MDT by NWS Pueblo CO","description":"* WHAT...For the Frost Advisory, temperatures may briefly dip into\nthe lower to mid 30s resulting in frost formation or a light\nfreeze. For the Freeze Watch, a longer period of sub-freezing\ntemperatures in the mid 20s to around 30 degrees will be possible.\n\n* WHERE...Eastern Fremont, Pueblo, Crowley, Otero, Las Animas,\nHuerfano, Bent, Prowers and Baca Counties.\n\n* WHEN...For the Frost Advisory, until 9 AM MDT this morning. For the\nFreeze Watch, from late tonight through Saturday morning.\n\n* IMPACTS...Frost and freeze conditions could kill crops, other\nsensitive vegetation and possibly damage unprotected outdoor\nplumbing. Frost could harm sensitive outdoor vegetation. Sensitive\noutdoor plants may be killed if left uncovered.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...The coldest readings will occur Friday night\ninto Saturday morning with a killing freeze possible, which could\nbring an end to the growing season.","ends":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-06:00","severity":"Severe","areaDesc":"Canon City Vicinity/Eastern Fremont County; Pueblo Vicinity/Pueblo County Below 6300 Feet; Walsenburg Vicinity/Upper Huerfano River Basin Below 7500 Ft; Trinidad Vicinity/Western Las Animas County Below 7500 Ft; Crowley County; La Junta Vicinity/Otero County; Eastern Las Animas County; Las Animas Vicinity/Bent County; Lamar Vicinity/Prowers County; Springfield Vicinity/Baca County","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.df86bcb3eaadf4c19b00acfb0d84d7c4e2aa3674.003.2","url":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.df86bcb3eaadf4c19b00acfb0d84d7c4e2aa3674.003.2"}],"afd":{"office":"PUB","issued":"2026-10-16T06:43:00+00:00","snippet":"000 FXUS65 KPUB 160643 AFDPUB Area Forecast Discussion National Weather Service Pueblo CO 1243 AM MDT